  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BookReader
  bookPanel: {fileID: 11221582}
  bookPrompt: {fileID: 886279709}
  titleText: {fileID: 710101721}
  storyText: {fileID: 1459113383}
  bookTitle: The Clockwork Rabbit
  story: 'Deep inside Wonderland, there was a small rabbit made of silver gears and
    golden springs.



    Unlike ordinary creatures, this clockwork rabbit did not
    follow time. It collected lost moments from travelers and stored them inside
    its tiny mechanical heart.



    Many wondered why the rabbit was always searching
    through forests and forgotten paths.



    Some believed it was trying to repair
    the past, while others believed it was looking for a new future.



    The rabbit
    never revealed its true purpose, but its ticking sound always guided lost travelers
    toward unexpected adventures.'
